iff iff a b a = iff iff suff (b a) (b a)

iff iff pref plex = suff
iff iff suff plex = pref
iff T iff plex = iff
iff F iff plex = xor
iff xor iff plex = F
iff iff iff plex = T
pref x y plex = x
suff x y plex = y

if = or pref iff plex

and/or/nor/nand one of them has to be premitive


base 	neg 	morg	switch
T	  	T	  	F		T
pref	npref	pref	suff
iff		iff		xor		iff
nand  	or 		nor		nand
if		then	nthen	then

xor suff npref plex

xor suff a b npref a b = xor b not a = xor
xor T not T = xor T F = T
xor T not F = F
xor F not T = F
xor F not F = T

iff pref xor plex=
iff pref a b xor a b = iff a xor a b
iff T xor T T = iff T F = F
iff T xor T F = iff T T = T

and/or/nor/nand one of them has to be premitive. we can't build 3/1 from 2/2 (and 4/0)

and a a = a
and a not a = f

nand a a = not a
and a not a = t

or a a = a
and a not a = t
